{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle structure carefully. The key constraint is \"the award itself was originally created in the 2000s.\" The Booker Prize (1969) doesn't fit, but the Man Booker International Prize was inaugurated in 2005 (the 2000s).\n\nLet me reconsider the Obioma lead. \"An Orchestra of Minorities\" (2019) was shortlisted for the regular Booker Prize. In 2019, the Booker was won by \"The Testaments\" (Atwood) and \"Girl, Woman, Other\" (Evaristo). But the Booker Prize was created in 1969, not the 2000s.\n\nLet me reconsider whether the puzzle might involve a different award entirely. Let me think about awards created in the 2000s and look at the structure differently. Perhaps Book A is a contender for an award created in the 2000s, and in the year Book A was published, Book B won that same award. Let me check the Man Booker International Prize 2019 winner (Celestial Bodies by Jokha Alharthi) and see if there's a book translated into 25+ languages that was a contender.\n\nLet me look at the International Booker Prize shortlists and winners in the 2010s more carefully.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"International Booker Prize 2019 shortlist Celestial Bodies Jokha Alharthi\", \"International Booker Prize 2018 shortlist Flights Olga Tokarczuk\", \"International Booker Prize 2017 shortlist winner\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_458a7f86b2a047dc9673e783","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"The Years Annie Ernaux translated languages International Booker\", \"The Discomfort of Evening Marieke Rijneveld translated languages\", \"At Night All Blood is Black David Diop translated languages International Booker\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_69a71c385509464fb6d58451","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789472967,"id":"chatcmpl-e3bd38dc-37e8-900d-8919-8c13358ab2f0","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":21797,"completion_tokens":372,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":22169,"cached_tokens":3456,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3456},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}